WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:26.078
Tom watched the horses gallop fast.

2
00:00:26.079 --> 00:00:29.595
His carriage flew over the ground.

3
00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:33.064
"My spell is working!" cried Tom.

4
00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:36.877
But Walter's swans were as fast as the horses.

5
00:00:36.878 --> 00:00:39.473
They bumped into Tom's carriage.

6
00:00:39.474 --> 00:00:46.319
Thump! Tom's carriage slowed down.

7
00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.802
"Oh no!" Tom cried.

8
00:00:48.803 --> 00:00:52.212
"Those swans knocked a wing off our carriage!"

9
00:00:52.213 --> 00:00:58.035
Walter and his king laughed as they flew by.

10
00:00:58.036 --> 00:01:01.147
"Cheaters!" Tom's king called.

11
00:01:01.148 --> 00:01:04.611
Tom's king was very upset. "Hurry, Tom!

12
00:01:04.612 --> 00:01:07.145
Fix our carriage!"

13
00:01:07.146 --> 00:01:13.192
Tom waved his wand again and again.

14
00:01:13.193 --> 00:01:17.226
At last a huge wing appeared on the wheel.

15
00:01:17.227 --> 00:01:20.515
The other wing grew huge too.

16
00:01:20.516 --> 00:01:24.501
The carriage flew high in the air.

17
00:01:24.502 --> 00:01:28.892
The horses went up very high too.

18
00:01:28.893 --> 00:01:31.747
They could not gallop anymore.

19
00:01:31.748 --> 00:01:34.227
"Oops!" Tom said.

20
00:01:34.228 --> 00:01:38.521
Tom waved his wand again.

21
00:01:38.522 --> 00:01:44.389
The wings grew very small.

22
00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:48.097
Now they could not lift the carriage off the road.

23
00:01:48.098 --> 00:01:50.898
"Oops!" Tom said.

24
00:01:50.899 --> 00:01:58.980
All the other royal carriages raced past.

25
00:01:58.981 --> 00:02:02.353
Tom's king moaned.

26
00:02:02.354 --> 00:02:06.202
"We'll never win now!" he said.

27
00:02:06.203 --> 00:02:08.853
Tom sighed.

28
00:02:08.854 --> 00:02:12.878
He could see Walter's swans far ahead.

29
00:02:12.879 --> 00:02:16.008
They were almost at the finish line.

30
00:02:16.009 --> 00:02:19.191
"Walter's king will win," he said.

31
00:02:19.192 --> 00:02:24.517
Then Tom saw something else in the road.

32
00:02:24.518 --> 00:02:28.349
It was Cat!
